<title>USA: Warburg to distribute Caribiner shares to partners.</title>
<headline>Warburg to distribute Caribiner shares to partners.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warburg, Pincus Investors LP intends to distribute two million shares of Caribiner International Inc to its partners at some time during the third quarter, depending on market conditions, Caribiner said Monday.</p>
<p>Warburg informed Caribiner of its plans, Caribiner said.</p>
<p>The distribution constitutes about 25 percent of Warburg's holdings in Caribiner.</p>
<p>After the distribution, Warburg will continue to hold about 26.7 percent of Caribiner's common stock.</p>
</text>
